            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>No sign-up needed. Play right away as a guest, or create a free Random Wars account from the title screen (about a minute) to save your score, kills, money and weapons, add a profile picture, and squad up with friends in a party.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Wars is an exhilarating first-person shooter (FPS) that immerses players in the life of a soldier from a broad perspective. The game is exclusively multiplayer, offering rigorous training, challenging simulations, and intense combat. Every mode in this game is crafted with a no-respawn rule, emphasizing swift action and a robust medic system. True to its name, the game's core concept is unpredictability, allowing players to engage in a vast array of maps designed by fellow soldiers, each with unique objectives to accomplish alongside your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An FPS that boasts a distinctive ballistic system, where gravity and gun positioning are critical factors to master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for both low-end and high-end configurations, ensuring a smooth gaming experience for a wide range of players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced netcode powered by Photon Engine, guaranteeing superior network synchronization for seamless gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A map editor feature that continuously rejuvenates the player's experience by offering new terrains to conquern</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
